      "source": "<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"Pageable.html#getPageNumber()\">getPageNumber</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\">Pageable</a></code></dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>the page to be returned or throws <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>UnsupportedOperationException</code></a> if the object is\n        <a href=\"Pageable.html#isUnpaged()\"><code>Pageable.isUnpaged()</code></a>.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>指定于：</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"Pageable.html#getPageNumber()\">getPageNumber</a></code> 接口 <code><a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\">Pageable</a></code></dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>要返回的页面，或者如果对象是 <a href=\"Pageable.html#isUnpaged()\"><code>Pageable.isUnpaged()</code></a> 则抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>UnsupportedOperationException</code></a>。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
