    {
      "source": "<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"Pageable.html#hasPrevious()\">hasPrevious</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\">Pageable</a></code></dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>true if there's a previous <a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> we can access from the current one.</dd>",
